WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.611
- But here's one thing
that I love that you did.

00:00:01.611 --> 00:00:04.360
I think you did it at
the beginning of The Talk

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.609
this season is you talked
openly about facelifts.

00:00:06.609 --> 00:00:07.442
- Yeah

00:00:07.442 --> 00:00:09.260
- Because it almost makes it less taboo

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:11.170
and less of a topic if you do.

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:12.700
That's what I love about Dolly Parton.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:13.900
She owns every bit of it.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.030
She's like "Yeah."
- Sure everything.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:15.863
That's it.

00:00:15.863 --> 00:00:18.051
Yeah yeah that's true.
- I love that you do that.

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.480
Because while some people might not

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.313
be comfortable with that,

00:00:20.313 --> 00:00:21.290
some people are comfortable with that.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:22.900
That's why they love to do it.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.510
And I love that you talk about it openly

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:25.410
because a lot of people don't.

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.440
And they're like "I
haven't had anything done."

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:28.877
- This is just the new cream.

00:00:28.877 --> 00:00:30.090
(audience laughs)

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.290
- It's my new cream. (laughs)

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.866
- Yes try this cream.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.930
It lifts everything overnight.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.466
- Lies and deception!

00:00:37.466 --> 00:00:39.207
- I know it's like oh please!

00:00:39.207 --> 00:00:40.990
(audience laughs)

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:42.540
- Is it hard?

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.990
Because I'm scared of
stuff, I'm terrified.

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:46.510
I can get tattoos, I have like 15.

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:47.370
But the thought of something.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:48.203
I'm scared of it.

00:00:48.203 --> 00:00:49.036
So you're never scared?

00:00:49.036 --> 00:00:50.350
You just go in and you're like "Yeah."

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:51.490
- I am, I am.

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:54.352
Yeah sure because you could
wake up and look like Cyclops.

00:00:54.352 --> 00:00:55.185
(audience laughs)

00:00:55.185 --> 00:00:56.640
You never know.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.550
And I had this thing where
they lifted up my mouth

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:04.650
and then for the first
week I couldn't feel my,

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:07.829
I can hardly feel my mouth
now to be honest with you.

00:01:07.829 --> 00:01:09.359
(audience laughs)

00:01:09.359 --> 00:01:11.013
But I couldn't find my mouth.

00:01:11.013 --> 00:01:13.621
- That would be handy
in certain scenarios.

00:01:13.621 --> 00:01:18.440
- Yeah but it's all numb
and it was up at one side

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:19.930
And I looked like Elvis.

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:22.737
And all the kids and Ozzy are going

00:01:22.737 --> 00:01:24.150
"Why are you snarling at me?"

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:27.260
I'm like "I'm not snarling,
I'm not doing anything!"

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:29.960
But it was this, it was going up like.

